# Positive-day desk (winning formula)

Goal: **green account days with real fills** — not a silent desk that avoids trades.

Do **not** remove `src/regime/dayModuleRules.ts` or `positiveDayDesk.ts` without an explicit user request.

## Prefer (keep firing)

- **QS Pro + Cipher B + Pro** prefer-base
- Prefer: 2 SL → soft throttle (still fires); 3 SL → hard pause
- Prefer post-TP pause **45m** (others 90m)
- Winning prefer day → demo risk ×1.25

## Day WR confidence (per module)

- After **≥3** EXECUTED fills today: confidence = win rate %
- **≥70%** → boost (prefer, more trades, risk ×1.25) unless 3+ SL hard pause
- **60–70%** → normal band (existing tier rules)
- **&lt;60%** → no new locks / no demo follow for that module today
- Friday **20:00 PKT → Mon open**: no new locks (weekend close)

## Cut losers (not silence everything)

- Demote Scalp always; Quick Scalp until proven green
- Fractal: live OK, **no demo follow** (same-print double)
- Lean family correlation cooldown
- Sell-lean day: block Scalp BUY

## Same-side stacking guards

Daily bias forces every desk onto one direction, so per-module tiers alone let
same-side SLs stack (24–28 Jul: 11 SELL SL of 18 SELL fills, 35% live WR).

- **Day side-stop** (`sideRisk`): 2 same-side SL → prefer desks only + 2h cooldown; 3 → that side banned for the day. Opposite side stays open.
- **Chase-after-TP** $8: block same-side entry already extended past the last lean-family TP entry (3h window)
- **Retrace-after-TP** $3: block same-side entry that pulled back past that TP entry — a plain time pause just gets waited out
- **Bounce guard** (`isCounterBounce`): block when price is $10+ off the 2h extreme with momentum flipped; `leanDeskEntryBlock` runs it for QS Pro + Fractal
- **QS Pro no-fractal fallback**: SMC conf ≥85 **and** `hasFreshExtreme` — never fade a live reversal on lagging MAs alone

## Demo equity rails

- Day stop **−3R** → no new auto-follows
- Day protect **+3R** → only prefer modules (0.75×)
- Day lock **+5R** → bank the green, stop new follows

## Learn / ML overlay

- Live CSV: `npm run learn -- --dir=D:/download`
- **OHLC backtest labels (20y M5):** `npm run learn:bt -- --file=data/XAU_5m_data.csv --days=365 --merge-csv=D:/download`
- **Weekly auto:** `npm run learn:weekly` / Railway worker (`ENABLE_WEEKLY_LEARN=auto`) — Sunday ~22:00 PKT, merge live + `labeled_20y.jsonl`, sanity-gated overwrite
- Artifact: `data/learn/sl_model.json` + `labeled_backtest.jsonl`
- Runtime: `gateLearnedLock` inside `gateNewLock`
- Backtest HTF = resampled from M5 (same as prod parity) — do not mix separate TF CSVs into one walk
- Do **not** add daily full-ML overwrite cron (overfit); weekly merge is the cadence
## Timeframes before lock (prod)

- **Scalping family** (Scalp, QS Pro, Cipher, Fractal, Quick Scalp, Intra30): **M5 entry** + M15 confirm + H1 bias + D1
- **Intraday / Pro:** **M15 entry** + H1 confirm + H4 bias + D1

## Do not

- Force zero trades as “risk management”
- Put Scalp back on demo auto-follow
- Replace rules with opaque ML only — keep autopsy rules + learned overlay
- Invent signals to force fills on quiet days
